        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Colorkeys program was developed into a software program designed to aid a teacher in a classroom setting.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The program allows kids to learn at their own pace and provides instant feedback and rewards to promote learning.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "There are millions of kids who will never be exposed to playing music due to budget cutbacks at their schools and money concerns at home.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Colorkeys aims to make its method available to children everywhere at an affordable cost.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Colorkeys method aims to make music education available to children everywhere at an affordable cost.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Colorkeys is developing an engaging music-based video game to help children learn how to play, read, and enjoy music.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The game will require children to complete tasks and stages before advancing to more material.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy"
      ],
      "type": "pipeline",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The software levels will be sequential, requiring students to master a concept before moving ahead.",
