  "innovation": [
    {
      "text": "Colorkeys is based on a patented color-coded note system.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "ip_asset",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The color-coded note system represents music and notes in colors that correspond to colored stickers used on music keys.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This system helps kids quickly connect the notes on the page with the keys on the keyboard.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Colorkeys is based on a patented color-coded note system where music and notes are represented in colors that correspond to colored stickers used on music keys.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "ip_asset",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Colorkeys helps kids quickly make the connection between the notes on the page and the keys on the keyboard.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the Colorkeys method, kids can begin to learn in a few hours what usually takes months of lessons to achieve.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The video game is designed to be both fun and based on sound academic principles.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A point system in the game will encourage children to finish activities and play accurately.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Children will practice music concepts without realizing it while mastering songs and understanding theoretical material.",
      "dimensions": [
        "innovation"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "innovation",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt48__openai",
